OL,3,GNEWSACouncil expects to spend #51m more
OL,4,Aon schools
OL,5,
OL,6,FLincolnshire County Council said it
OL,7,Fexpects to spend #51m more than
OL,8,Fbudgeted on schools this year.
OL,10,FThe authority said it was experiencing
OL,11,F"significant financial pressures" on
OL,12,Fservices, with budget papers warning
OL,13,Fthe overspend is due to more young
OL,14,Fpeople needing Special Education Needs
OL,15,Fand Disabilities (SEND) support in
OL,16,Fschools.
OL,18,FThe government announced earlier this
OL,19,Fyear it would pay off most debts after
OL,20,Fa warning that eight in 10 councils
OL,21,Fwould face bankruptcy from money built
OL,22,Fup over SEND.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
